{"ref":"BDB, רָם","hw":"רָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  an ancestor of David, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:19\" href=\"/Ruth.4.19\">Ru 4:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, brother of Jerachmeel <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.9\">1 Ch 2:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.10\">10</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  son of J. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.25\">1 Ch 2:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.27\">27</a>.—Αρραν, Ραμ, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  name of Elihu’s family, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:2\" href=\"/Job.32.2\">Jb 32:2</a> (Ραμ[α], Αραμ), dub., cf. Bu.","next":"BDB, רָמָה","prev":"BDB, רוֹמָה"}